SDP81_Band4_CalibratedData.tgz contains the calibrated uv-data:

* SDP.81_Band4.ms
* SDP.81_Band4_continuum.ms

To produce these calibrated datasets you will need to execute the calibration
scripts in SDP81_Band4_CalibrationScripts.tgz and follow the imaging script
that is located at the CASA guide page listed above.

SDP.81_Band4.ms is the spectrally averaged continuum calibrated dataset.


